      "body": "<!-- Thank you for your contribution! Please follow these guidelines to enhance your pull request. If anything is unclear, submit your PR and reach out to maintainers for assistance. Join our Slack community at https://slack.sglang.io to discuss further. -->\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\nThe goal for this request is to decrease TTFT for concurrence request processing.\r\n\r\n## Modifications\r\n\r\nadd thread pool to preprocess next requests in parallel with processing current by model.\r\n\r\n## Accuracy Tests\r\n\r\nin progress .....\r\n\r\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\r\n\r\naverage TTFT decreased from 65228ms to 49125ms (-25%) for GLM5.2 model on A3 TP16 context 180K, chunk 16K, 95% prefix cache for 17 requests with concurrency 17.\r\n\r\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\r\n---\r\n### CI States\r\n\r\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #37493336867](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37493336867)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #37493337472](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37493337472)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\r\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #37493337165](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/37493337165)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\r\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
